      <title>修复README错别字却要等25分钟：这些CI/CD错误正悄然拖慢团队部署</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260831/%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8DREADME%E9%94%99%E5%88%AB%E5%AD%97%E5%8D%B4%E8%A6%81%E7%AD%8925%E5%88%86%E9%92%9F%E8%BF%99%E4%BA%9BCICD%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E6%AD%A3%E6%82%84%E7%84%B6%E6%8B%96%E6%85%A2%E5%9B%A2%E9%98%9F%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2/</link>
